    "云端 API Key 只保存在 macOS 钥匙串中；本地来源无需密钥。添加来源时无需选择模型。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cloud API keys are stored only in the macOS Keychain; local sources need no key. You don't need to choose a model when adding a source."
